    "created_at": "2022-02-23T14:04:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-02-23T14:05:53Z",
    "body": "Right so after digging more, this is a problem of nerd fonts using private space with emojis. It seems that even giving more precise informations to both fish and the terminal about the width was not enough, so the only solution seem to be to not add any emojis that are in the private space (aka ambiguous width) to the right hand of a `fill`, as it does not leave space on the line for these additional width to go.\r\n\r\nTechnically you would be allowed the one with the same width as you defined in your terminal and fish, but as they can have different width... at this point the solution would be to fill a bug in the nerd font repo",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
