    "updated_at": "2022-02-23T14:19:03Z",
    "body": "Yeah just checked. So fish get the cloud emoji width incorrectly and the space is definitely needed. \r\n\r\nThe fun part is that `…` is also it seems problematic.\r\n\r\nIf i change the settings of my terminal compatibility for ambiguous width to `wide`, it fix the space on the right hand, but it adds a space after `…` on the left and still truncate.\r\n\r\nIf i put it on narrow, i get the space on the right hand but the no space after `…`",
