    "updated_at": "2022-02-23T14:41:23Z",
    "body": "So i would advise:\r\n- Starship should not use an emoji in that range by default for a module\r\n- Nerds Font should put the cloud emoji in another range.\r\n\r\nI think they put it in this range because it is big and they want to be able to take 2 characters, but it is highly problematic for all these reasons and prone to these kind of problems in the different terminal.",
